Z||000007||batboy||02-20-2000||12:15 PM||||Here's a thought, stick in a good set of cheap used Fiero seats temporarily and keep looking for a good passenger seat to match your original seats (other driver's seats will probably be worn out). Swap the covers from the good passenger seat over onto the old driver seat. Switch the seats back in. Sell the second set of seats to cover expenses and you're back in business.||||reg||1
